    IF `the person is a sub-lessee or creditor within section 1022(1)` AND `the person declines to accept a vesting order on such terms`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A sub-lessee or creditor declining to accept a vesting order on such terms"; a person who does not decline is not mentioned

-- (4) If there is no person claiming under the company who is willing to accept an order on such terms, the court has
