    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "“company” includes any body corporate"

-- (1) The section applies where on the dissolution of a company land in England and Wales or Northern Ireland that is
-- subject to a rentcharge vests by operation of law in the Crown or any other person ("the proprietor").
-- src:14284 | (1) This section applies where on the dissolution of a company land in England and Wales or Northern Ireland that is subject to a rentcharge vests by operation of law in the Crown or any other person (“the proprietor”).
